italism-and-communism" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Distinctions from Capitalism and Communism</a></li><li style="padding-left:0.75rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#etymology-and-conceptual-evolution" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Etymology and Conceptual Evolution</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#origins-of-the-term" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Origins of the Term</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#shifts-in-meaning-over-time" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Shifts in Meaning Over Time</a></li><li style="padding-left:0.75rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#historical-development" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Historical Development</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#pre-modern-precursors-and-influences" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Pre-Modern Precursors and Influences</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#19th-century-foundations" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">19th-Century Foundations</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#early-20th-century-revolutions-and-spread" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Early 20th-Century Revolutions and Spread</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#mid-20th-century-implementations" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Mid-20th-Century Implementations</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#late-20th-century-crises-and-transitions" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Late 20th-Century Crises and Transitions</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#21st-century-revivals-and-adaptations" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">21st-Century Revivals and Adaptations</a></li><li style="padding-left:0.75rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#theoretical-frameworks" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Theoretical Frameworks</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#critique-of-capitalism-as-motivation" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Critique of Capitalism as Motivation</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#marxist-and-dialectical-materialism-foundations" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Marxist and Dialectic