on's libertarian socialism is thus based on the principle of autonomy, but it is also on an individualistic conception since the ...\",\"url\":\"https://kpu.pressbooks.pub/political-ideologies/chapter/4-2-2-libertarian-socialism/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"160\",\"title\":\"What Is Mutualism? | Libertarianism.org\",\"description\":\"Jul 28, 2020 · In Proudhon's mutualism, individuals deal with one another as co-​equal producers, as essentially economic actors, no one empowered to ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.libertarianism.org/articles/what-mutualism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"161\",\"title\":\"Mutualism | The Anarchist Library\",\"description\":\"Mutualists follow Proudhon in envisioning future social organizations as economic rather than political. They see society as organized around free federations ...\",\"url\":\"https://theanarchistlibrary.org/library/jeff-shantz-mutualism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"162\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Mutualism and gradualism in Proudhon - Monde-nouveau\",\"description\":\"Mar 25, 2025 · For Proudhon, mutualism is an alternative to the impasse of state socialism (from above) and cooperative socialism (from below), which he.\",\"url\":\"https://monde-nouveau.net/IMG/pdf/mutualism_and_gradualism_in_proudhon.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"163\",\"title\":\"Bakunin vs. Marx | libcom.org\",\"description\":\"1. Marxists believe in the creation of a \\\"peoples' state\\\" or a \\\"workers' state\\\"; anarchists believe in the abolition of the state.\",\"url\":\"https://libcom.org/article/bakunin-vs-marx\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"164\",\"title\":\"Bakunin vs. Marx | The Anarchist Library\",\"description\":\"Bakunin did not \\\"deliberately fabricate\\\" the accusation that Marx believed in the \\\"People's State\\\". Bakunin criticised Marx for this in 1870 and 1872. He could ...\",\"url\":\"https://theanarchistlibrary.org/library/sam-dolgoff-bakunin-vs-marx\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"165\",\"title\":\"Anarchist Communism: Its Basis and Principles\",\"description\":\"Title: Anarchist Communism. Subtitle: Its Basis and Principles. Author: Pëtr Kropotkin. Topic: anarcho-communism. Date: 1927. Source: Retrieved on June 24, 2009 ...I · II · Additional Note to “Anarchist...\",\"url\":\"https://theanarchistlibrary.org/library/petr-kropotkin-anarchist-communism-its-basis-and-principles\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"166\",\"title\":\"Communism and Anarchy | The Anarchist Library\",\"description\":\"With Anarchy as an aim and as a means, Communism becomes possible. Without it, it necessarily becomes slavery and cannot exist.\",\"url\":\"https://theanarchistlibrary.org/library/petr-kropotkin-communism-and-anarchy\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"167\",\"title\":\"Anarcho-Syndicalism in the Spanish Revolution\",\"description\":\"Jan 4, 2023 · Spanish anarchism was a pure workers' movement; the intellectuals of the country, with rare exceptions, did not join it. But the level of the ...Foreword · The evolution of the CNT over... · The May Days and the...\",\"url\":\"https://theanarchistlibrary.org/library/helmut-rudiger-anarcho-syndicalism-in-the-spanish-revolution\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"168\",\"title\":\"Spain 1936, the end of anarchist syndicalism? - Subversion\",\"description\":\"Russian anarcho-syndicalists commemorate the Spanish revolution. A group of activists of the Russian section of the International Workers' Association (IWA ...\",\"url\":\"https://libcom.org/article/spain-1936-end-anarchist-syndicalism-subversion\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"169\",\"title\":\"Socialism with an Anarchist Squint - Strange Matters\",\"description\":\"The initial boost these groups got meant more members, more money, more visibility, and thus greater attractiveness for your typical anarchist to want to get ...\",\"url\":\"https://strangematters.coop/libertarian-socialism-economic-planning-anarchist-supply-chains/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"170\",\"title\":\"The Socialist Preacher - Institute for Chris