-with-west-germany-since-fall-of-communism-but-still-lags/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"196\",\"title\":\"China Overview: Development news, research, data | World Bank\",\"description\":\"Since China began to open up and reform its economy in 1978, GDP growth has averaged over 9 percent a year, and more than 800 million people have lifted ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldbank.org/en/country/china/overview\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"197\",\"title\":\"Economic Issues 8 -- Why Is China Growing So Fast?\",\"description\":\"China's strong productivity growth, spurred by the 1978 market-oriented reforms, is the leading cause of China's unprecedented economic performance.\",\"url\":\"https://www.imf.org/external/pubs/ft/issues8/index.htm\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"198\",\"title\":\"Venezuela: Socialism, Hyperinflation, and Economic Collapse | AIER\",\"description\":\"Mar 1, 2017 · The economy contracted over 10 percent in 2016, and inflation accelerated to 700 percent. President Nicolás Maduro is continuing the disastrous ...\",\"url\":\"https://aier.org/research/venezuela-socialism-hyperinflation-and-economic-collapse/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"199\",\"title\":\"How Socialism Destroyed Venezuela - Manhattan Institute\",\"description\":\"Mar 21, 2019 · As economic theory predicted, as state control of the agricultural industry increased, Venezuela's food production fell 75% in two decades ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://manhattan.institute/article/how-socialism-destroyed-venezuela\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"200\",\"title\":\"100 Years of Communism: Death and Deprivation | Cato Institute\",\"description\":\"Oct 28, 2017 · “The Black Book of Communism,” a postmortem of communist atrocities compiled by ... deaths under communist regimes … (is) upward of 80 ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.cato.org/commentary/100-years-communism-death-deprivation\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"201\",\"title\":\"New insights into the scale of killing in the USSR during the 1930s\",\"description\":\"This essay disproves both these contentions by introducing new demographic evidence proving that Stalin killed at least 5.2 million Soviet citizens 1927–1938.\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0967067X97000111\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"202\",\"title\":\"Death and Redemption: The Gulag and the Shaping of Soviet Society\",\"description\":\"May 19, 2011 · The Gulag is widely understood to have been the Soviet Union's death camp. In his new book, Steven Barnes gave the Gulag a second look.\",\"url\":\"https://www.wilsoncenter.org/event/death-and-redemption-the-gulag-and-the-shaping-soviet-society\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"203\",\"title\":\"Cambodia 1975–1979 - United States Holocaust Memorial Museum\",\"description\":\"From April 17, 1975, to January 7, 1979, the Khmer Rouge perpetrated one of the greatest crimes of the 20th century. Nearly two million people died.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.ushmm.org/genocide-prevention/countries/cambodia/cambodia-1975\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"204\",\"title\":\"Cuba: Fidel Castro's Record of Repression - Human Rights Watch\",\"description\":\"Nov 26, 2016 · Such abusive practices generated a pervasive climate of fear in Cuba ... JBS and the EU's Exposure to Human Rights Violations and Illegal ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.hrw.org/news/2016/11/26/cuba-fidel-castros-record-repression\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"205\",\"title\":\"World Report 2024: Venezuela | Human Rights Watch\",\"description\":\"Venezuelans continued to suffer repression and a humanitarian crisis. More than 270 political prisoners are behind bars. About 19 million people are in need.\",\"url\":\"https://www.hrw.org/world-report/2024/country-chapters/venezuela\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"206\",\"title\":\"Cuba - United States Department of State\",\"description\":\"The government frequently denied all political prisoners access to home visits, prison classes, telephone calls, and