or|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://econfaculty.gmu.edu/bcaplan/pdfs/socialismimpossible.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"212\",\"title\":\"Why the USSR Collapsed Economically - Investopedia\",\"description\":\"May 22, 2024 · Newly-empowered local leaders demanded greater autonomy from central authority, shaking the foundations of the command economy, while more ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.investopedia.com/articles/investing/021716/why-ussr-collapsed-economically.asp\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"213\",\"title\":\"Consequences of the Collapse of the Soviet Union\",\"description\":\"Between 1989 and 1991, the gross national product in Soviet countries fell by 20 percent, ushering in a period of complete economic breakdown. Eastern European ...\",\"url\":\"https://online.norwich.edu/online/about/resource-library/consequences-collapse-soviet-union\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"214\",\"title\":\"Venezuela: All you need to know about the crisis in nine charts - BBC\",\"description\":\"Feb 4, 2019 · The country hit crisis levels the following year, with GDP shrinking by almost 6% and inflation soaring. Oil output has been declining since.\",\"url\":\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-latin-america-46999668\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"215\",\"title\":\"Why did Venezuela's economy collapse? - Economics Observatory\",\"description\":\"Sep 23, 2024 · Estimates suggest that over 7.7 million people have left the country since the start of the crisis. By the end of the decade, the Venezuelan ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.economicsobservatory.com/why-did-venezuelas-economy-collapse\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"216\",\"title\":\"Socialism Has Destroyed Venezuela | The Heritage Foundation\",\"description\":\"Aug 2, 2017 · The economy has contracted dramatically—gross domestic product in 2017 will be nearly 25 percent smaller than when Chavez died in 2013.\",\"url\":\"https://www.heritage.org/americas/commentary/socialism-has-destroyed-venezuela\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"217\",\"title\":\"Cambodia « World Without Genocide - Making It Our Legacy\",\"description\":\"Jan 8, 2025 · Response. When the Vietnamese took control in 1979, Cambodia was in ruins. The economy had failed ... Cambodia and Khmer Rouge member Hun Sen ...\",\"url\":\"https://worldwithoutgenocide.org/genocides-and-conflicts/cambodia\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"218\",\"title\":\"Space, Time, and Genocide Under the Khmer Rouge, 1975–79\",\"description\":\"Mar 4, 2016 · ... Cambodian genocide by tracing the contours of those social and economic processes that succeeded and failed during the four years of CPK rule.\",\"url\":\"https://utppublishing.com/doi/10.3138/gsi.10.1.07\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"219\",\"title\":\"The Spectre of the Khmer Rouge over Cambodia | United Nations\",\"description\":\"Consequently, an emboldened Khmer Rouge refused to be disarmed by UNTAC, leading to a total failure in demobilization and an escalation of security problems ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.un.org/en/chronicle/article/spectre-khmer-rouge-over-cambodia\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"220\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Reversing the Soviet Economic Collapse\",\"description\":\"The decline of the Soviet economy is sometimes explained by exoge- nous shocks, like the troubles in the oil industry, the coal strike in the first quarter of ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.brookings.edu/wp-content/uploads/1991/06/1991b_bpea_shleifer_vishny.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"221\",\"title\":\"Socialism Must Be Authoritarian | The Daily Economy\",\"description\":\"Mar 11, 2020 · Even benevolent socialists must become authoritarians. Worse, people in power under socialism are unlikely to be benevolent.\",\"url\":\"https://thedailyeconomy.org/article/socialism-must-be-authoritarian/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"222\",\"title\":\"How Does Friedrich Hayek's The Road to Serfdom Criticize Socialism?\",\"description\":\"Dec 24, 2023 · Friedrich Hayek's book The Road to Serfdom raised important questions about how much government intervention is necessary for a successful society.\",\"url\":\"https://www.thecollector.com/friedrich-hayek-road-to-serfdom-socialism/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"223\",\"title\":\"[PDF] The Road to Serfdom - Mises Institute\",\"description\":\"Apr 26, 1999 · Hayek employed economics to investigate the mind of man, using the knowledge he had gained to unveil the totalitarian nature of socialism and to ...\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.mises.org/Road%2520to%2520serfdom.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"224\",\"title\":\"The Collapse of Socialism | American Enterprise Institute - AEI\",\"description\":\"In particular, the collapse of the Soviet Union spelled the end of socialism, not merely of Stalinism and the more rigid forms of socialism.\",\"url\":\"https://www.aei.org/research-products/speech/the-collapse-of-socialism/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"225\",\"title\":\"Three Nations That Tried Socialism and Rejected It\",\"description\":\"Oct 16, 2019 · After 70 years of Marxism, Soviet farms were unable to feed the people, factories failed to meet their quotas, people lined up for blocks in ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.heritage.org/progressivism/commentary/three-nations-tried-socialism-and-rejected-it\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"226\",\"title\":\"The Myth of Scandinavian Socialism | The Heritage Foundation\",\"description\":\"Apr 20, 2022 · Scandinavian “socialism” does not exist, except in the Marxian imagination of radical progressives. It is a chimera wrapped in an illusion inside a dream.\",\"url\":\"https://www.heritage.org/progressivism/commentary/the-myth-scandinavian-socialism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"227\",\"title\":\"Nordic Countries Aren't Actually Socialist - Foreign Policy\",\"description\":\"Oct 27, 2021 · While Nordic countries are seeing a partial comeback for social democratic parties, their policies aren't in fact socialist, but centrist.\",\"url\":\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2021/10/27/nordic-countries-not-socialist-denmark-norway-sweden-centrist/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"228\",\"title\":\"Index of Economic Freedom: All Country Scores\",\"description\":\"Explore the Index of Economic Freedom to gauge global impacts of liberty and free markets. Discover the powerful link between economic freedom and progress.\",\"url\":\"https://www.heritage.org/index/pages/all-country-scores\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"229\",\"title\":\"Norway - Index of Economic Freedom - The Heritage Foundation\",\"description\":\"Norway's economic freedom score is 78.3, making its economy the 9th freest in the 2025 Index of Economic Freedom. Its rating has increased by 0.8 point from ...Missing:  Nordic | Show results with:Nordic\",\"url\":\"https://www.heritage.org/index/pages/country-pages/norway\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"230\",\"title\":\"Denmark's prime minister says Bernie Sanders is wrong to call his ...\",\"description\":\"Oct 31, 2015 · “Therefore, I would like to make one thing clear. Denmark is far from a socialist planned economy. Denmark is a market economy.”\",\"url\":\"https://www.vox.com/2015/10/31/9650030/denmark-prime-minister-bernie-sanders\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"231\",\"title\":\"Privatization of Swedish Welfare Services in the 1990s | Request PDF\",\"description\":\"Aug 7, 2025 · In the early 1990s, Sweden implemented a school voucher system that allowed privately operated schools to compete on an equal financial basis ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/227955224_The_Choice_Revolution_Privatization_of_Swedish_Welfare_Services_in_the_1990s\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"232\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/sweden-partially-privatized-its-social-security-heres-how-it-has-worked-out-2019-09-06\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"233\",\"title\":\"Sweden's much more 'free market' than you think\",\"description\":\"Dec 5, 2023 · The country deregulated markets in the 1990s, privatized state-owned companies, cut spending and reduced taxes.\",\"url\":\"https://realitiesofsocialism.org/article/swedens-much-more-free-market-than-you-think\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"234\",\"title\":\"The Nordic Model is Not A Socialist Model, It is Capitalist - Medium\",\"description\":\"Jan 6, 2024 · This extensive exploration aims to dissect the Nordic model in-depth, revealing its capitalist core, sophisticated use of tax revenues, and the nuanced reasons ...\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/the-simulacrum/the-nordic-model-is-not-a-socialist-model-it-is-capitalist-bbe828d17a8a\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"235\",\"title\":\"State of DSA Part One: Welcome to DSA - Democratic Left\",\"description\":\"Feb 27, 2025 · For decades, DSA hovered around 5,000 members. Then, suddenly, from 2016 to 2020, DSA's membership ballooned to about 50,000. An average of ...\",\"url\":\"https://democraticleft.dsausa.org/2025/02/27/state-of-dsa-part-one-welcome-to-dsa/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"236\",\"title\":\"Democratic Socialists of America (DSA) - ADL\",\"description\":\"down from a high of 95,000 in 2020, though more than the ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.adl.org/resources/backgrounder/democratic-socialists-america-dsa\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"237\",\"title\":\"List of Democratic Socialists of America public officeholders\",\"description\":\"In 2025, there were over 250 DSA members in office, with 90% elected after 2019. From 2016 to 2025, 128 nationally-endorsed candidates won an election, and 31 ...\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Democratic_Socialists_of_America_public_officeholders\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"238\",\"title\":\"Democratic Socialists of America (DSA) -\",\"description\":\"Bernie Sanders launched a political revolution and DSA continues to build it, training our chapters to effectively support democratic socialist candidates ...What is Democratic Socialism? · About Us · Chapter List · Leadership and Structure\",\"url\":\"https://www.dsausa.org/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"239\",\"title\":\"Crisis in Venezuela - Wikipedia\",\"description\":\"By 2014, Venezuela had entered an economic recession and by 2016, the country had an inflation rate of 800%, the highest in its history.\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crisis_in_Venezuela\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"240\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.mtdemocrat.com/news/national/bolivians-look-right-for-a-new-president-ending-two-decades-of-socialism/article_fdc4aad9-ae12-5899-951d-752fdc5c39dc.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"241\",\"title\":\"Bolivia's Defeat of Socialism Signals a Continental Realignment | AIER\",\"description\":\"Aug 28, 2025 · It took 20 years to defeat Evo Morales's Movement Toward Socialism (MAS) in Bolivia through elections. Two decades of political battle lines ...\",\"url\":\"https://aier.org/article/bolivias-defeat-of-socialism-signals-a-continental-realignment/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"242\",\"title\":\"The ongoing attack of 21st-century socialism on Ecuador to ...\",\"description\":\"Oct 5, 2025 · Once democracy is restored, 21st-century socialism constantly attacks Ecuador to sustain its criminal organization. Ecuador was a dictatorship ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.intdemocratic.org/en/the-ongoing-attack-of-21st-century-socialism-on-ecuador-to-overthrow-democracy.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"243\",\"title\":\"The basic income experiment in Finland yields surprising results\",\"description\":\"May 7, 2020 · The verdict was that there was very little difference in employment or earned income between the groups. Over the first year of the experiment, ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.helsinki.fi/en/news/fair-society/basic-income-experiment-finland-yields-surprising-results\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"244\",\"title\":\"12,000 Californians get cash from income experiments - CalMatters\",\"description\":\"Feb 14, 2023 · A report on Stockton's program released in 2021 found that one year in, those who received the guaranteed income were nearly twice as likely as ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://calmatters.org/california-divide/2023/02/universal-basic-income/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"245\",\"title\":\"California Program Giving $500 No-Strings-Attached Stipends Pays ...\",\"description\":\"Mar 4, 2021 · A high-profile universal basic income experiment in Stockton, Calif., which gave randomly selected residents $500 per month for two years with no strings ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/2021/03/04/973653719/california-program-giving-500-no-strings-attached-stipends-pays-off-study-finds\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"246\",\"title\":\"Stockton guaranteed income study finds pandemic ... - CalMatters\",\"description\":\"Apr 12, 2023 · A final study on Stockton's famous experiment giving low-income residents unconditional cash found the money improved some recipients' mental health and ...\",\"url\":\"https://calmatters.org/california-divide/2023/04/california-guaranteed-income/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"247\",\"title\":\"Young Americans Like Socialism Too Much—That's a Problem ...\",\"description\":\"May 15, 2025 · A total of 43 percent said they have a “favorable” view of socialism, and for those aged 18–29, 62 percent said favorable. For communism, a ...Missing:  experiments | Show results with:experiments\",\"url\":\"https://www.cato.org/blog/young-americans-socialism-too-much-thats-problem-libertarians-must-fix\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"248\",\"title\":\"One third of millennials view socialism favorably - YouGov\",\"description\":\"May 11, 2015 · 36% of under-30s have a positive view of socialism, while 39% have a positive view of capitalism. Among over-65s, who came of age at the height ...\",\"url\":\"https://today.yougov.com/politics/articles/12313-one-third-millennials-like-socialism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"249\",\"title\":\"What Americans think about socialism and capitalism, according to a ...\",\"description\":\"Sep 8, 2025 · ... Democrats have both warmed slightly on socialism since 2010. But Democrats under 50 are much less likely to view capitalism favorably, while ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.ap.org/news-highlights/spotlights/2025/what-americans-think-about-socialism-and-capitalism-according-to-a-new-gallup-poll/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"250\",\"title\":\"Gen Z and Millennials Prefer Socialism to Capitalism, New Poll Says\",\"description\":\"Sep 15, 2025 · A new poll from Data for Progress found that a majority of Democratic voters preferred democratic socialism to capitalism.\",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/gen-z-millennials-prefer-socialism-213336661.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"251\",\"title\":\"2020 Poll - Victims of Communism Memorial Foundation\",\"description\":\"30% of Gen Z has a favorable view of Marxism, up 6% from 2019, compared to 27% of Millennials, down 9% from 2019. Over one-third of Americans (39%) are likely ...\",\"url\":\"https://victimsofcommunism.org/annual-poll/2020-annual-poll/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"252\",\"title\":\"Survey: Nearly two-thirds of young Americans support socialism\",\"description\":\"Jun 20, 2025 · The survey found that 62 percent of adults under age 30 expressed a favorable view of socialism, while just 38 percent held an unfavorable view.\",\"url\":\"https://www.campusreform.org/article/survey-nearly-two-thirds-young-americans-support-socialism/28114\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"253\",\"title\":\"Capitalism Isn't the Enemy — What Young Voters Really Want\",\"description\":\"Jul 11, 2025 · Meanwhile, a 2025 survey by the Cato Institute and YouGov found that 62% of Americans aged 18–29 say they hold a “favorable view” of “socialism ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.aei.org/op-eds/capitalism-isnt-the-enemy-what-young-voters-really-want/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"254\",\"title\":\"On Young Americans and their Growing Acceptance of Socialism\",\"description\":\"Sep 24, 2025 · Their survey found that 53% of Americans aged 18-39 would like to see a democratic socialist candidate win the 2028 presidential election, while ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.pacificresearch.org/on-young-americans-and-their-growing-acceptance-of-socialism/\",\"favicon\":\"\"}],\"images\":[{\"id\":\"8d652c89d024\",\"caption\":\"Karl Marx by John Jabez Edwin Mayall\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/Karl_Marx_by_John_Jabez_Edwin_Mayall_1875_-_Restored.png\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"8d652c89d024\",\"caption\":\"Karl Marx portrait\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/Karl_Marx_by_John_Jabez_Edwin_Mayall_1875_-_Restored.png\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"668842c0372b\",\"caption\":\"Claude Henri de Saint-Simon\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/Claude_Henri_de_Saint-Simon.jpg\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"1bf4a4c6a323\",\"caption\":\"Lev Trotsky\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/Lev_Trotsky_1906-3.3_V1.jpg\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"8d652c89d024\",\"caption\":\"Karl Marx, circa 1875\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/Karl_Marx_by_John_Jabez_Edwin_Mayall_1875_-_Restored.png\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"c28b621d4185\",\"caption\":\"Claude Henri de Saint-Simon, a key utopian socialist thinker\",\"url\":\"._assets_/Claude_Henri_de_Saint-Simon.jpg\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"9fb83798b2a8\",\"caption\":\"CyberSyn operations room render\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/CyberSyn-render-106.png\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"abd573025940\",\"caption\":\"icon\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/A_coloured_voting_box.svg.png\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0},{\"id\":\"abd573025940\",\"caption\":\"icon\",\"url\":\"./_assets_/A_coloured_voting_box.svg.png\",\"position\":\"CENTER\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0}],\"fixedIssues\":[],\"slug\":\"Socialism\",\"title\":\"Socialism\",\"content\":\"$1e\",\"description\":\"Socialism\\n\\nKarl Marx by John Jabez Edwin Mayall \\nSocial